xt":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"role":"collection","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"Swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami"}}}